#: ceaae65c058b4ac0ae52376d7010cc49 e89405a620264b5682e410cb0740999a
msgid ""
"The low cost IMUs (accelerometers, gyros, compass) used in most autopilots "
"drift too quickly to allow position estimation without an external velocity "
"or position source.  In other words, low-cost IMUs on their own are not "
"sufficient for estimating position."
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控使用的低成本 IMU（加速度计、陀螺仪、罗盘）漂移过快，无法在没有外部速度或位置来源的情况下进行位置估算。换句话说，低成本 IMU "
"本身不足以用于位置估算。"

